# Users & Organisational Units

## OU Structure

cloudlab.local
├── HR/Users, HR/Computers
├── Engineering/Users, Engineering/Computers
├── Finance/Users, Finance/Computers
└── IT/Users, IT/Computers


## User management tasks practiced
- Created initial user (John Smith) + additional test users per department
- Reset password (+ force change at next logon)
- Disable / re-enable account
- Unlock account (Account tab)
- Move user between OUs (e.g. simulating a department transfer)

## Real world use case
These are the single most common tickets a Tier 1 agent handles: 
password resets, account lockouts, and access changes following 
department moves.
